/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-bowls-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 206px) 100vw, 206px\" />																<h4>Chicken Bowl</h4>										<a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Order Now\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"206\" height=\"206\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-tacos.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-tacos.jpg 206w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-tacos-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 206px) 100vw, 206px\" />																<h4>Baja Shrimp Tacos</h4>										<a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Order Now\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"300\" height=\"122\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-lifestyle-burritos-300x122.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-lifestyle-burritos-300x122.jpg 300w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-lifestyle-burritos-1024x416.jpg 1024w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-lifestyle-burritos-768x312.jpg 768w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-lifestyle-burritos-1536x624.jpg 1536w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-lifestyle-burritos.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />																<h4>Veggie Burrito</h4>										<a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Order Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Build Your Perfect Meal</h2>		<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#DDE8C9;font-size:16px\">Your bowl. Your burrito. Your way.</p>													<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-bowls-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-bowls-150x150.jpg 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-bowls.jpg 206w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />																<h6>CHOOSE BASE</h6>															<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-chicken-tray-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-chicken-tray-150x150.jpg 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-chicken-tray.jpg 206w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />																<h6>CHOOSE PROTEIN</h6>															<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-toppings-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-toppings-150x150.jpg 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-toppings.jpg 206w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />																<h6>ADD TOPPINGS</h6>															<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Guacamole-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Guacamole-150x150.png 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Guacamole-300x300.png 300w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Guacamole-768x768.png 768w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Guacamole.png 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />																<h6>PICK YOUR SAUCE</h6>															<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-stamp-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-stamp-150x150.png 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-stamp-300x300.png 300w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-stamp.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />																<h6>CHECKOUT</h6>										<a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Start Building\n					</a>\n									<h2>Catering Made Easy</h2>		<p style=\"text-align:left;color:#2E2E28;font-size:16px\">Tacos, bowls, fajitas and more. Perfect for any size group or occasion.</p>								<a href=\"https://www.toasttab.com/catering/locations/ad67d5f8-f740-4412-9d3a-9937c2650648\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Order Catering\n					</a>\n									<h2>Eat More. Earn More.</h2>							\n				<p style=\"margin:0\"><strong style=\"color:#1F4D2C\">Earn Points</strong><br>Every order earns you points.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M32 448c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32h160V320H32v128zm256 32h160c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32V320H288v160zm192-320h-42.1c6.2-12.1 10.1-25.5 10.1-40 0-48.5-39.5-88-88-88-41.6 0-68.5 21.3-103 68.3-34.5-47-61.4-68.3-103-68.3-48.5 0-88 39.5-88 88 0 14.5 3.8 27.9 10.1 40H32c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32v80c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h480c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-80c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32zm-326.1 0c-22.1 0-40-17.9-40-40s17.9-40 40-40c19.9 0 34.6 3.3 86.1 80h-86.1zm206.1 0h-86.1c51.4-76.5 65.7-80 86.1-80 22.1 0 40 17.9 40 40s-17.9 40-40 40z\"></path></svg>			\n				<p style=\"margin:0\"><strong style=\"color:#1F4D2C\">Gift Rewards</strong><br>Redeem points for free food & perks.</p>					\n				<p style=\"margin:0\"><strong style=\"color:#1F4D2C\">Birthday Reward</strong><br>A little something on us.</p>								<a href=\"https://www.toasttab.com/uberrito-atascocita/rewardsSignup\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Join Rewards\n					</a>\n									<h2>Find Your Nearest Uberrito</h2>		<p style=\"color:#6B6B5E;font-size:15px\">Freshly prepared meals are just around the corner — enter your zip to find the nearest Uberrito and order for pickup or delivery.</p>			<style>.ubr-zipwrap{width:100%}.ubr-zipbar{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:6px 0 18px}.ubr-zipbar input{flex:1;min-width:200px;border:2px solid #E2E6D6;border-radius:50px;padding:14px 20px;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;font-size:15px;outline:none}.ubr-zipbar input:focus{border-color:#5E9E2E}.ubr-zipbar button{background:#1F4D2C;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:50px;padding:14px 28px;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.5px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .25s}.ubr-zipbar button:hover{background:#5E9E2E}.ubr-map{width:100%;height:380px;border:0;border-radius:18px}</style><input id=\"ubrZip\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter city, state or zip code\" aria-label=\"Search location\"><button type=\"button\" onclick=\"ubrFind()\">Find Location</button><iframe id=\"ubrMap\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Uberrito%20Texas&output=embed\"></iframe>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '41-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-16 23:47:48', '2026-07-16 23:47:48', '', 41, 'https://staging.uberrito.com/?p=95', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
