2026/07/ph-lifestyle-burritos-768x312.jpg 768w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-lifestyle-burritos-1536x624.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" />																<h2>What Are You In The Mood For?</h2>															<img width=\"206\" height=\"206\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-burrito-spread.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-burrito-spread.jpg 206w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-burrito-spread-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 206px) 100vw, 206px\" />																<h5>BURRITOS</h5>															<img width=\"221\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-surf-turf-bowl-221x300.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-surf-turf-bowl-221x300.png 221w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-surf-turf-bowl.png 605w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 221px) 100vw, 221px\" />																<h5>BOWLS</h5>															<img width=\"206\" height=\"206\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-tacos.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-tacos.jpg 206w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-tacos-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 206px) 100vw, 206px\" />																<h5>TACOS</h5>															<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Salad-1-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Salad-1-300x300.png 300w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Salad-1-150x150.png 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Salad-1-768x768.png 768w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Salad-1.png 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />																<h5>SALADS</h5>															<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/burrito-in-a-bowl-1-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/burrito-in-a-bowl-1-300x300.png 300w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/burrito-in-a-bowl-1-150x150.png 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/burrito-in-a-bowl-1.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />																<h5>KIDS</h5>															<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-chips-guacamole-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-chips-guacamole-300x300.png 300w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-chips-guacamole-150x150.png 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-chips-guacamole-768x768.png 768w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-chips-guacamole.png 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />																<h5>SIDES &amp; DRINKS</h5>		<p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center\">Limited Time</p>			<h2>Summer Flavors.<br>Here for a Limited Time.</h2>		<p>Fresh ingredients. Bright flavor. Only here for a limited time.</p>								<a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Try It Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Fan Favorites</h2>															<img width=\"206\" height=\"206\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-burrito-spread.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-burrito-spread.jpg 206w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-burrito-spread-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 206px) 100vw, 206px\" />																<h4>Carne Asada Burrito</h4>		<p>Fajita steak, cilantro-lime rice, black beans, pico, roasted corn and your favorite salsa.</p><p>Pricing varies by location · Calories vary by build</p>								<a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Order Now\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"221\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-surf-turf-bowl-221x300.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-surf-turf-bowl-221x300.png 221w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-surf-turf-bowl.png 605w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 221px) 100vw, 221px\" />																<h4>Chicken Bowl</h4>		<p>Grilled chicken, fresh greens or rice, beans, fajita veggies and house-made salsa.</p><p>Pricing varies by location · Calories vary by build</p>								<a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Order Now\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"206\" height=\"206\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-tacos.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-tacos.jpg 206w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-tacos-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 206px) 100vw, 206px\" />																<h4>Baja Shrimp Tacos</h4>		<p>Grilled shrimp, crisp slaw, pico and a bright, creamy finish.</p><p>Pricing varies by location · Calories vary by build</p>								<a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Order Now\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/burrito-in-a-bowl-1-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/burrito-in-a-bowl-1-300x300.png 300w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/burrito-in-a-bowl-1-150x150.png 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/burrito-in-a-bowl-1.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />																<h4>Veggie Bowl</h4>		<p>Fresh greens, rice, beans, roasted corn, fajita veggies, guacamole and salsa.</p><p>Pricing varies by location · Calories vary by build</p>								<a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Order Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Build It Your Way.</h2>		<p>Start with the base. Finish with your flavor.</p>													<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-bowls-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-bowls-150x150.jpg 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-bowls.jpg 206w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />																<h6>CHOOSE BASE</h6>															<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-chicken-tray-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-chicken-tray-150x150.jpg 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-chicken-tray.jpg 206w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />																<h6>CHOOSE PROTEIN</h6>															<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-toppings-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-toppings-150x150.jpg 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ph-toppings.jpg 206w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />																<h6>ADD TOPPINGS</h6>															<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Guacamole-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Guacamole-150x150.png 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Guacamole-300x300.png 300w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Guacamole-768x768.png 768w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Guacamole.png 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />																<h6>PICK YOUR SAUCE</h6>															<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-stamp-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-stamp-150x150.png 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-stamp-300x300.png 300w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-stamp.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />																<h6>CHECKOUT</h6>										<a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Build My Meal\n					</a>\n									<h2>Bring Uberrito To The Party.</h2>		<p>Flexible packages for groups big or small, with fresh, customizable menus and easy pickup or delivery.</p>Taco barsFajita spreadsWrapped burritos								<a href=\"https://www.toasttab.com/catering/locations/ad67d5f8-f740-4412-9d3a-9937c2650648\" target=\"_blank\">\n									View Catering Options\n					</a>\n									<img src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-loaded-nachos-wide.png\" alt=\"Loaded Uberrito nachos for a group\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-surf-turf-bowl.png\" alt=\"Uberrito surf and turf bowl\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/uberrito-chips-guacamole.png\" alt=\"Uberrito chips and fresh guacamole\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">Fresh for every crowd					<h2>Good Food Should Pay You Back.</h2>							\n				<p style=\"margin:0\"><strong style=\"color:#1F4D2C\">Earn Points</strong><br>Every order earns you points.</p>					\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M32 448c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32h160V320H32v128zm256 32h160c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32V320H288v160zm192-320h-42.1c6.2-12.1 10.1-25.5 10.1-40 0-48.5-39.5-88-88-88-41.6 0-68.5 21.3-103 68.3-34.5-47-61.4-68.3-103-68.3-48.5 0-88 39.5-88 88 0 14.5 3.8 27.9 10.1 40H32c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32v80c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h480c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-80c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32zm-326.1 0c-22.1 0-40-17.9-40-40s17.9-40 40-40c19.9 0 34.6 3.3 86.1 80h-86.1zm206.1 0h-86.1c51.4-76.5 65.7-80 86.1-80 22.1 0 40 17.9 40 40s-17.9 40-40 40z\"></path></svg>			\n				<p style=\"margin:0\"><strong style=\"color:#1F4D2C\">Gift Rewards</strong><br>Redeem points for free food & perks.</p>					\n				<p style=\"margin:0\"><strong style=\"color:#1F4D2C\">Birthday Reward</strong><br>A little something on us.</p>								<a href=\"https://www.toasttab.com/uberrito-atascocita/rewardsSignup\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Join Rewards\n					</a>\n									<h2>Find Your Uberrito.</h2>		<p>Search less. Eat sooner. Choose your location and order for pickup or delivery.</p>			\n    <label for=\"ubrZip\">Search by city, state or ZIP code</label>\n    <input id=\"ubrZip\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Enter city, state or ZIP code\" aria-label=\"Search by city, state or ZIP code\">\n    <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"ubrFind()\">Find a Location</button>\n      <iframe id=\"ubrMap\" title=\"Map showing Uberrito locations\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Uberrito%20Atascocita%20Texas&output=embed\"></iframe>\n      <article>\n        Humble / Atascocita\n        <h3>Uberrito Atascocita</h3>\n        <p>7025 FM 1960 East<br>Humble, TX 77346</p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Uberrito+7025+FM+1960+East+Humble+TX+77346\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Directions</a>\n          <a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start Order</a>\n      </article>\n      <article>\n        Sugar Land\n        <h3>Uberrito Sugar Land</h3>\n        <p>Sugar Land, Texas<br>Pickup and delivery available</p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Uberrito+Sugar+Land+Texas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Directions</a>\n          <a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start Order</a>\n      </article>\n					<h2>Two Texas Kitchens<small>Your neighborhood stop for fresh flavor.</small></h2>					<h2>Fresh. Modern. Welcoming.<small>A better place to grab lunch or stay awhile.</small></h2>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '41-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-16 23:47:49', '2026-07-16 23:47:49', '', 41, 'https://staging.uberrito.com/?p=96', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
