p-content/uploads/2026/07/Grilled-Chicken.webp\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Grilled Chicken</h3>', 'Uberrito Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '115-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-20 09:39:13', '2026-07-20 09:39:13', '', 115, 'https://staging.uberrito.com/?p=333', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
