p-content/uploads/2026/07/Grilled-Chicken.webp\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Grilled Chicken</h3>		<p>OFFICIAL MERCH</p>			<h2>WEAR THE\n UBERRITO\nLIFESTYLE\n</h2>		Take your favorite brand beyond the table with premium apparel, drinkware and everyday essentials designed for true Uberrito fans.								<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">\n									SHOP MERCH\n					</a>\n						Limited Collection • Premium Quality													<img width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"http://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/summer-flavors-1024x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/summer-flavors-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/summer-flavors-300x300.webp 300w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/summer-flavors-150x150.webp 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/summer-flavors-768x768.webp 768w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/summer-flavors.webp 1254w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />', 'Uberrito Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '115-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-20 10:19:34', '2026-07-20 10:19:34', '', 115, 'https://staging.uberrito.com/?p=367', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
