1024x1024.webp 1024w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/merch-official-300x300.webp 300w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/merch-official-150x150.webp 150w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/merch-official-768x768.webp 768w, https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/merch-official.webp 1254w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />																<h2>EAT MORE.\nEARN MORE.ENJOY MORE.\n</h2>		<p>Join Uberrito Rewards and earn points every time you order.<br />Redeem exclusive rewards, birthday treats and member-only offers.</p>			<figure><img width=\"1288\" height=\"755\" src=\"http://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/eat-more.webp\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>ORDER</h3><p>Order online, scan your app or use your rewards account every visit.</p>					<figure><img src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h3>EARN</h3><p>Earn points on every purchase and unlock exclusive member rewards.</p>					<figure><img src=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h3>REDEEM</h3><p>Redeem points for free food, exclusive offers and surprise rewards.</p>										<a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">\n									JOIN REWARDS\n					</a>', 'Uberrito Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '115-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-07-20 11:41:29', '2026-07-20 11:41:29', '', 115, 'https://staging.uberrito.com/?p=451', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
