(539, 2, '2026-07-20 13:48:26', '2026-07-20 13:48:26', '<h1>FRESH. BOLD.<br>MADE DAILY.</h1>		<p>Fresh ingredients. Big flavor. Made your way. <br />Build the burrito, bowl, tacos or salad you are craving.</p>								<a href=\"https://uberrito.toast.site\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Start Your Order\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/menu/\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Explore the Menu\n					</a>\n											<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\"></path></svg>						\n										4.8 ★ Google\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M546.2 9.7c-5.6-12.5-21.6-13-28.3-1.2C486.9 62.4 431.4 96 368 96h-80C182 96 96 182 96 288c0 7 .8 13.7 1.5 20.5C161.3 262.8 253.4 224 384 224c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16s-7.2 16-16 16C132.6 256 26 410.1 2.4 468c-6.6 16.3 1.2 34.9 17.5 41.6 16.4 6.8 35-1.1 41.8-17.3 1.5-3.6 20.9-47.9 71.9-90.6 32.4 43.9 94 85.8 174.9 77.2C465.5 467.5 576 326.7 576 154.3c0-50.2-10.8-102.2-29.8-144.6z\"></path></svg>						\n										Fresh Daily\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M444.52 3.52L28.74 195.42c-47.97 22.39-31.98 92.75 19.19 92.75h175.91v175.91c0 51.17 70.36 67.17 92.75 19.19l191.9-415.78c15.99-38.39-25.59-79.97-63.97-63.97z\"></path></svg>						\n										Texas Locations\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n																	<img width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"http://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/bowl-and-glass-1024x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://staging.uberrito.com/wp-content